<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia financiers warn oil boom could be a curse.</title>
<headline>Colombia financiers warn oil boom could be a curse.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's oil boom could be a curse rather than a windfall unless the government takes rapid steps to protect other areas of the economy, an influential financial group warned Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Without the right precautions, economic dependence on oil frequently sparks extremely grave problems and sometimes the development of the oil sector can crush other traditional sectors,&quot; the National Association of Financial Institutions (ANIF) said in its weekly report.</p>
</text>
